.TH BREATH 1 "2026-08-31" "breath 0.8.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
breath \- guided breathing exercises for GNOME
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B breath
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B breath
is a native GNOME application that guides breathing exercises with visual
phase animations and optional audio cues. Choose a breathing pattern, set a
session duration, and follow the inhale, hold, and exhale phases.
.PP
A three-second countdown is shown before each session. Sessions can be
paused, resumed, stopped, or left with the back button or the Escape key.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /usr/share/breath/audio/
Bundled voice and bell guidance audio.
.TP
.I /usr/share/glib-2.0/schemas/io.github.moriwaka.Breath.gschema.xml
Application preferences schema.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR gnome-control-center (1)
